Convince them in a clear, and reasoned, and logical way, that Article 13 as it's currently written

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.860
will cause significant harm to the European Internet

00:14:22.870 --> 00:14:25.828
We need MEPs to understand what's really going on here,

00:14:25.828 --> 00:14:29.169
And think through the consequences of the language of the law.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.940
